                                    <property name="tooltip-text" translatable="yes">Draws the Center/Size above as a wireframe box in the 3D view, using VisMol's own unit-cell representation -- the SAME box a docking run would actually search. Click again after changing Center/Size to move/resize the same box (no new object is created on repeat clicks).</property>
